name: sim.getPropertyInfo
description: Fetches information about a specific property
luaSynopsis: int type, int flags, string description = sim.getPropertyInfo(int target, string propertyName dict options = {})
pythonSynopsis: int type, int flags, string description = sim.getPropertyInfo(int target, string propertyName map options = {})
inputs:
1. target: target item
2. propertyName: property name
3. options: an optional map. Set options.shortInfoTxt to true to fetch a short version of the description text
outputs:
1. type: property type
2. flags: property flags
3. description: property description
